","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"旅馆卧疾辱元冈公以诗见贻依韵奉答兼以寄怀二绝 其一","author":"林大春","text":"肺病经时归梦频，祇缘词客意相亲。\n闭门偶尔寻丹诀，得句犹怀问字人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":11527,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"旅馆卧疾辱元冈公以诗见贻依韵奉答兼以寄怀二绝 其二","author":"林大春","text":"马卿作赋传西蜀，狗监从容奏上林。\n湖水坐连千里碧，春风空对百花深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":11528,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"萧都事席上戏赠歌者二首 其一","author":"林大春","text":"谁云燕赵有佳人，越女今看翠黛新。\n一曲清歌君不见，馀音犹自绕梁尘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":11529,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"萧都事席上戏赠歌者二首 其二","author":"林大春","text":"清歌宛转玉箫閒，嬴女空传引凤还。\n任是萧郎同化去，何如却住在人间。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":11530,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠刘山人葛衣","author":"林大春","text":"万里归来一绤单，凭君莫作等閒看。\n不缘溽暑深相赠，欲待凄风耐岁寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":11531,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山阴姚生过潮谒予请书走笔赋此","author":"林大春","text":"曲水兰亭绕碧云，茂林修竹望中分。\n旧游此日翻成梦，好为殷勤谢右军。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":11532,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"万历甲戌暮春四日实谢郡丞初度之辰时年六十有四也甲周伊始别墅重开宾朋毕集笙歌满座予闻而庆以是诗二首 其一","author":"林大春","text":"别墅春深启寿筵，曾逢甲子度周天。\n如今又喜添三岁，欲待桃开定几千。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":11533,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"万历甲戌暮春四日实谢郡丞初度之辰时年六十有四也甲周伊始别墅重开宾朋毕集笙歌满座予闻而庆以是诗二首 其二","author":"林大春","text":"朝来禊事酒初醒，又见群仙礼寿星。\n过客不知蓬岛会，还疑逸少醉兰亭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":11534,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"戴使君自广州归壶山取道见访因作此赠之四首 其一","author":"林大春","text":"见说壶公三径荒，广南太守兴偏长。\n已将心事追黄绮，肯把功名比赵张。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":11535,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"戴使君自广州归壶山取道见访因作此赠之四首 其二","author":"林大春","text":"龙门禹穴号奇游，汉水燕山亦壮猷。\n不见罗浮长啸客，秋来乘兴到沧洲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":11536,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"戴使君自广州归壶山取道见访因作此赠之四首 其三","author":"林大春","text":"清宵百里泛湖天，犹忆当年访戴船。\n此日相看浑似昔，争知岭外别风烟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":11537,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"戴使君自广州归壶山取道见访因作此赠之四首 其四","author":"林大春","text":"海上方壶一剑劖，閒中日月自题缄。\n何年共理兰溪棹，卧看飞云避雨岩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":11538,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄丘上舍","author":"林大春","text":"有客携琴到海滨，与君云是结交亲。\n公然不寄一行字，何况扁舟访故人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":11539,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送人之梧州","author":"林大春","text":"曾随幕府典兵符，郡国犹藏汉版图。\n此去若过泷水上，逢人应说旧苍梧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":11540,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄赠徐贡元","author":"林大春","text":"曾衔丹诏下江城，再接音书太古情。\n闻道贤良今得荐，未应曲学负邹生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":11541,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"海阳余生以求书冯明府兴学之碑过予因为二首赠之 其一","author":"林大春","text":"绵蕞初开马上翁，两生不发笑孙通。\n嗟君此去缘何事，应为贤侯化育功。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":11542,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"海阳余生以求书冯明府兴学之碑过予因为二首赠之 其二","author":"林大春","text":"传言贞石起荒陂，疑是当年汉水移。\n何似今朝重文教，漫求拙笔写丰碑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":11543,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题溪云深处为张别驾","author":"林大春","text":"碧溪之上白云飞，早出晚步溪云归。\n閒来自拟登楼赋，恨不停云坐钓矶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":11544,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"辛未新春试笔二首 其一","author":"林大春","text":"朝来轻暖试纤罗，风物熙然总太和。\n为报桃花今已破，春光终比旧年多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":11545,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"辛未新春试笔二首 其二","author":"林大春","text":"空阶纵步听鸣鸠，谁信山人春思幽。\n惟有窗前双蛱蝶，閒随清梦到庄周。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":11546,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"以笔墨秋扇赠郑使君戏成三绝 其一","author":"林大春","text":"梦中五色寻常见，醉里千文秃似山。\n留却一枝新更好，凭君挥洒落人间。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":11547,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"以笔墨秋扇赠郑使君戏成三绝 其二","author":"林大春","text":"刚丢半点光如漆，一月能消得几分。\n闻道草玄今尚白，故将石墨赠扬云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":11548,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"以笔墨秋扇赠郑使君戏成三绝 其三","author":"林大春","text":"霜标玉质好谁同，执手踟躇等画工。\n莫向凉飙叹萧瑟，山间时自有炎风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":11549,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送劳掌教之任连州四首 其一","author":"林大春","text":"横经几载卧潮阳，再转湟州秋色凉。\n莫道宦游千里隔，风烟犹尔是同乡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":11550,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送劳掌教之任连州四首 其二","author":"林大春","text":"曾向云间陪二陆，却从岭左拜昌黎。\n于今匹马连山道，翻作青衿两地思。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":11551,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送劳掌教之任连州四首 其三","author":"林大春","text":"探奇乘兴望沧溟，时向东山万古亭。\n此去登临谁最胜，联翩白鹤倚秋汀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":11552,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送劳掌教之任连州四首 其四","author":"林大春","text":"吾乡多士屡蜚声，报道都充六馆英。\n玉铎流音君更远，行看丹阙荐阳城。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":11553,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"冬日过同年赵司理话旧遂成四绝 其一","author":"林大春","text":"曲江宴罢几经春，君入荆兮我使秦。\n往事祇今俱莫问，与君同是倦游人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":11554,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"冬日过同年赵司理话旧遂成四绝 其二","author":"林大春","text":"论交夙昔尽豪游，半立螭头侍冕旒。\n一自风流波荡后，谁能白发老丹丘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":11555,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"冬日过同年赵司理话旧遂成四绝 其三","author":"林大春","text":"归欤吾道任洄环，那复姬公入梦班。\n独有凤凰台上客，逢人犹自说孤山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":11556,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"冬日过同年赵司理话旧遂成四绝 其四","author":"林大春","text":"山林朝市孰高深，须识孙登一啸心。\n可奈同乡各异县，何当杖屦日相寻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":11557,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送海阳曾广文之虔州掌教二首 其一","author":"林大春","text":"横经几涉凤凰溪，又报除书赴水西。\n莫道广文官尚冷，青云到处拥轮蹄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":11558,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送海阳曾广文之虔州掌教二首 其二","author":"林大春","text":"三江遥接楚天来，二水中流越岭开。\n定有蛟龙从此伏，凭君色笑动风雷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":11559,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重至凤城会龚别驾同暴参戎夜游金山四首 其一","author":"林大春","text":"往年曾过凤凰城，却遇君侯朝帝京。\n更被王孙招隐去，于今车盖始初倾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":11560,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重至凤城会龚别驾同暴参戎夜游金山四首 其二","author":"林大春","text":"君家先子号名臣，况复遗思渤海滨。\n此日相逢重相惜，知君不忝旧儒绅。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":11561,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重至凤城会龚别驾同暴参戎夜游金山四首 其三","author":"林大春","text":"谁道韩江秋寂寞，扁舟叶叶倚烟霞。\n登临更有参军赋，烂醉何妨对菊花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":11562,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重至凤城会龚别驾同暴参戎夜游金山四首 其四","author":"林大春","text":"凌风重上最高台，日暮歌钟动地来。\n为道主人能爱客，无劳更鼓漫相催。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":11563,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻金大参久不视事诗以奉讯四首 其一","author":"林大春","text":"先朝抗疏柏台臣，云是南中第一人。\n二十年来持斧处，至今风动八闽春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":11564,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻金大参久不视事诗以奉讯四首 其二","author":"林大春","text":"从来骨鲠冠清班，吾道无因自楚还。\n见说乡闾须表正，徵书谁遣到家山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":11565,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻金大参久不视事诗以奉讯四首 其三","author":"林大春","text":"海国频年息战争，凭君谁敢负初盟。\n严城一箭飞难到，径路惟看彻晓行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":11566,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻金大参久不视事诗以奉讯四首 其四","author":"林大春","text":"厌历封疆晓雾多，禁中应复忆廉颇。\n旧游知己寻常是，何事芳心绕薜萝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":11567,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠海阳冯明府二首 其一","author":"林大春","text":"再宴曲江感二难，勾吴家学擅衣冠。\n君今出宰真馀绪，勋业还将汗竹看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":11568,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠海阳冯明府二首 其二","author":"林大春","text":"徵书应怪驿来迟，制锦文成祇自知。\n汉家封侯男儿事，况及冯唐未老时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":11569,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"汉高斩蛇便面","author":"林大春","text":"堪笑群雄竞逐鹿，谁知白帝化为蛇。\n今朝老妪当涂哭，明日车书是汉家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":11570,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶以敝衣遗刘山人山人以季子遇荣老事辞口占答之","author":"林大春","text":"季子居高视曷卑，荣公一笑古来稀。\n当年道左遗何物，不是升堂老敝衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":11571,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为刘山人题扇上景赠别洪广文之福安福安宋行在也二首 其一","author":"林大春","text":"荷蒉曾过孔氏门，幽怀遥寄万山云。\n孤村寥落归来晚，满背斜阳欲献君。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":11572,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为刘山人题扇上景赠别洪广文之福安福安宋行在也二首 其二","author":"林大春","text":"独棹孤舟向海涯，此中曾作帝王家。\n于今往事俱陈迹，惟见蟠桃几树花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":11573,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画","author":"林大春","text":"松声草色孤舟夜，江上微茫月影斜。\n千里幽怀凭寄语，欲乘春兴入桃花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":11574,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日独坐我庐家兄以数瓜见贻示曰此邵平遗种也诗以代意","author":"林大春","text":"世上秾华漫尔遗，个中风物几人知。\n多君得此能相赠，况是东陵五色奇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":11575,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题夏昶四时画竹图四首 其一 凤池春雨","author":"林大春","text":"龙种初栽凤沼边，春深玉立已参天。\n为乘好雨添幽色，不是浓云与淡烟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":11576,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题夏昶四时画竹图四首 其二 淇园晴翠","author":"林大春","text":"修篁怪石俨仙班，长日轻风响佩环。\n无限晴光重苍翠，淇园何物更追攀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":11577,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题夏昶四时画竹图四首 其三 悬崖老节","author":"林大春","text":"偃仰悬崖几度秋，老龙蜕骨入林幽。\n扶疏直节干霄上，化作长虹跨九州。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":11578,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题夏昶四时画竹图四首 其四 湘州雪霁","author":"林大春","text":"万顷潇湘雪乱翻，朝来开霁玉为坤。\n惟馀绿叶孤标在，不见英皇染泪痕。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":11579,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宫辞三绝送黄虞部北上 其一","author":"林大春","text":"青丝为髻羽为衣，曾侍君王步辇归。\n却笑新妆太清素，故令下界玩芳菲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":11580,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宫辞三绝送黄虞部北上 其二","author":"林大春","text":"兰闺独立已多时，月白风清祇自知。\n忽忆主恩浑未报，频将青镜照蛾眉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":11581,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宫辞三绝送黄虞部北上 其三","author":"林大春","text":"夜度箫笙入紫霄，晨飘仙佩杂琼瑶。\n如今老却纤纤手，肯向人间学舞腰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":11582,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠谢左史二首 其一","author":"林大春","text":"曾闻贾傅出长沙，前席恩深恋汉家。\n往事祇今付湘水，閒随渔父入桃花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":11583,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠谢左史二首 其二","author":"林大春","text":"月上高枝夜未眠，时闻染翰落云烟。\n临川笔意应谁似，一箑挥来价十千。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":11584,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠王广文还馀姚四首时广文以徵其伯父阳明先生像赞至 其一","author":"林大春","text":"晋代风流忆谢安，笑将明月对玄看。\n为询赌墅围棋处，孰与君家小杏坛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":11585,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠王广文还馀姚四首时广文以徵其伯父阳明先生像赞至 其二","author":"林大春","text":"七国纷纷睨上都，将军东下夜平吴。\n可怜赐食堪惆怅，争似吾皇礼硕儒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":11586,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠王广文还馀姚四首时广文以徵其伯父阳明先生像赞至 其三","author":"林大春","text":"冀北云游入楚天，行囊一束旧青毡。\n南来为访林和靖，祇少梅花赋几联。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":11587,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠王广文还馀姚四首时广文以徵其伯父阳明先生像赞至 其四","author":"林大春","text":"五岳年来梦已虚，凭君犹自忆匡庐。\n归途倘过东林社，好寄渊明一纸书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":11588,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠陈广文移官江藩四首 其一","author":"林大春","text":"钟灵泉水碧泠泠，台上孤梅老更青。\n一自梅开梅落后，更无泉溜响空庭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":11589,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠陈广文移官江藩四首 其二","author":"林大春","text":"羡尔来游古道还，渐看春色上贤关。\n閒来浚取灵源水，散作烟云满旧山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":11590,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠陈广文移官江藩四首 其三","author":"林大春","text":"帝子分封自汉初，威仪礼数降乘舆。\n当年董贾俱为傅，何处王门不曳裾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":11591,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠陈广文移官江藩四首 其四","author":"林大春","text":"抱璞当年识者稀，一官三共道应非。\n若教羊胜公孙在，怪得文园乞病归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":11592,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"余在梧时尝赠刘生诗箑一执既别去八年闻其箑尚在兹有复持扇至为生请书者因走笔寄此二首 其一","author":"林大春","text":"梧中一箑数行书，赠尔曾经八载馀。\n此日重书还此箑，料应执手更踟躇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":11593,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}}]